{"obsah":"<p>On Saturday we had to split our team into two separate units. Martin Šimůnek and Matouš Balík headed to Milíkov to ride an exhibition and run a small workshop for the kids.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F07%2FIMG_6344.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F07%2FIMG_6344.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-210904\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F07%2FIMG_6348.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F07%2FIMG_6348.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-210901\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F07%2FIMG_6346.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F07%2FIMG_6346.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-210902\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F07%2FIMG_6353.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F07%2FIMG_6353.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-210903\"/></a></figure>\n</figure>\n\n<p>Vlasta, Marek Tryner and Katarína Tóthová, on the other hand, headed to Zádveřice, which was really packed with spectators and side programme. An accident on the motorway caused a delay, but the organiser forgave us and the guys did a solid job. They even earned a parcel of frgál cakes and refreshments for the workshop, which took place on the local asphalt pump track and jumps under Katarína's guidance.</p>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F07%2FIMG_6380.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F07%2FIMG_6380.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-210913\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F07%2FIMG_6379.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F07%2FIMG_6379.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-210906\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F07%2FIMG_6365.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F07%2FIMG_6365.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-210905\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F07%2FIMG_6367.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F07%2FIMG_6367.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-210907\"/></a></fig